  "pages": [
    {
      "title": "Where the options live",
      "text": [
        "Options are TOML files, and each option has a comment in its file. bwr-gameplay.toml, bwr-grid.toml and bwr-server.toml are per world, in the world's serverconfig folder. bwr-common.toml and bwr-panels.toml are in the config folder, and so is the client-only bwr-visuals.toml.",
        "",
        "The next pages list every option with its default, file by file. This book itself is given to each player once, on first join, by giveGuideOnFirstJoin."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "bwr-gameplay.toml, part 1",
      "text": [
        "giveGuideOnFirstJoin = true",
        "instantRefuelling = false (the refuelling map moves fuel instantly)",
        "uraniumOreGeneration = true (new chunks only)",
        "reprocessingMaxDecayHeatKw = 50.0 (0 turns the check off)",
        "accidentProgressionMultiplier = 1.0",
        "failureHazardPerSecond = 0.02 (random pipe boundary failure; 0 = off)",
        "contaminationHalfLifeSeconds = 86400.0",
        "contaminationDoseMultiplier = 1.0 (0 = no dose effects)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "bwr-gameplay.toml, part 2",
      "text": [
        "wallStrengthK = 5.8",
        "wallStrengthCapPsig = 250.0",
        "rodColletFailureHazardPerSecond = 0.0 (random rod drift; 0 = off)",
        "rodDriftNotchesPerSecond = 0.1",
        "antimonyExposureHours = 48.0",
        "cobaltExposureHours = 72.0",
        "tritiumExposureHours = 168.0",
        "siliconExposureHours = 24.0",
        "tritiumSamplesPerRod = 1250",
        "instantHeadRemoval = false (the head button lifts and seats the head at once, with no tensioner or crane)",
        "turbineAuxRequired = true (a turbine section a player places new needs oil, a turning gear and generator cooling; sections already placed are not changed)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "bwr-grid.toml and bwr-server.toml",
      "text": [
        "bwr-grid.toml (per world):",
        "gridTieMaxMW = 1500.0",
        "",
        "bwr-server.toml (per world):",
        "coriumAltersWorld = true (off: the accident is still simulated, but no blocks change)",
        "coriumBlocksPerTick = 48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "bwr-common.toml (containment)",
      "text": [
        "maxInteriorCells = 200000",
        "maxSpan = 128",
        "scanCellsPerTick = 4000",
        "revalidateTicks = 600",
        "strengthScanDepth = 16",
        "penetrationContainmentPsig = 150.0",
        "vaultDoorContainmentPsig = 200.0",
        "airlockContainmentPsig = 120.0",
        "steamPenetrationDesignPsig = 1250.0",
        "steamPenetrationCodeLimitPsig = 1375.0",
        "waterPenetrationDesignPsi = 2500.0",
        "passThroughDesignPsi = 1480.0",
        "powerPenetrationFePerTick = 100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "bwr-panels.toml and bwr-visuals.toml",
      "text": [
        "bwr-panels.toml (config folder):",
        "maxGroupColumns = 16, maxGroupRows = 8",
        "maxComponentsPerBlock = 256, maxLabelLength = 16",
        "sampleTicks = 2, linkRange = 64",
        "networkLineShareDistance = 32, feToJoules = 2.5",
        "",
        "bwr-visuals.toml (client only):",
        "visualEffects = \"AUTO\", panelGpuCache = true",
        "networkLineViewDistance = 32, panelTextFade = true"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
